    <p class="eyebrow">Understand</p>
    <h1>The world is changing faster than any one person can process.</h1>
    <p class="lede">AI is reshaping work, education, relationships, institutions, and the information environment while climate, politics, economic pressure, and technological change interact. People are not imagining the difficulty of staying oriented.</p>
