<section class="boundary-section">
  <div class="section-shell boundary-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Hii World Model</p>
    <h2>Not another feed. A place to orient.</h2>
    <p>The Hii World Model is being designed to help people see important developments, inspect why each signal was included, follow its provenance, compare competing interpretations, and understand how changes in one domain may affect another. It is not an oracle, a prediction engine, or a substitute for direct evidence.</p>
  </div>
</section>

